$ help print-cert
print-cert - Prints the current certificate being used or the certificate for the provided vpn addr
  -raw
    	prints the PEM encoded certificate; with -json, an object holding it
  -json
    	outputs as json
  -pretty
    	pretty prints json, assumes -json

